         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">UJ4C075060K3S - Silicon Carbide (SiC) Cascode JFET â€“ EliteSiC, Power Nâ€Channel, TO247â€3, 750 V, 58 mohm</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The UJ4C075060K3S is a 750 V, 58 mÎ© G4 SiC FET. It is based on unique `cascode' circuit configuration, in which a normallyâ€on SiC JFET is coâ€packaged with a Si MOSFET to produce a normallyâ€off SiC FET device. The device's standard gateâ€drive characteristics allows for a true â€œdropâ€in replacementâ€ to Si IGBTs, Si FETs, SiC MOSFETs or Si superjunction devices. Available in the TO247â€3 package, this device exhibits ultraâ€low gate charge and exceptional reverse recovery characteristics, making it ideal for switching inductive loads and any application requiring standard gate drive.&#xA;</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <xmp:CreatorTool>BroadVision, Inc.</xmp:CreatorTool>
